                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.85/176: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Chile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-05-27T13:00:00-04:00">May 27, 1943—1 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>554. Department’s 531, May 20, 6 p.m. The War Shipping Administration, under date
                    of May 20 submitted to Mr. Subercaseaux an offer for the three vessels. There
                    has been no response as yet from Subercaseaux.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
